        "point": "",
        "lock": "all",
        "until": "tap",
        "untilTarget": "",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "The fog swallowed everything past the Townhall. But fog, like most things in this kingdom, can be bought back.",
        "box": "bottom",
        "point": "",
        "lock": "all",
        "until": "tap",
        "untilTarget": "",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "See the trees in the dark? Tap that patch. Five taps clear a cell, and every tap costs a pinch of Gold.",
        "box": "auto",
        "point": "feature:TreesFog",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "questProgress",
        "untilTarget": "FirstSteps",
        "untilAmount": 1,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Timber! Clear three more forest cells — the scroll keeps count.",
        "box": "auto",
        "point": "feature:TreesFog",
        "lock": "map",
        "until": "questComplete",
        "untilTarget": "FirstSteps",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "A task done is a reward waiting. Tap the scroll.",
        "box": "middle",
        "point": "quest",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "questClaimed",
        "untilTarget": "FirstSteps",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "morningBook",
    "trigger": "questReached",
    "triggerTarget": "Woodcraft",
    "triggerAmount": 0,
    "anywhere": true,
    "skippable": false,
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Our woodcutters have forgotten their craft. The Book of Civics will remind them.",
        "box": "middle",
        "point": "ui:nav:research",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "overlay",
        "untilTarget": "research",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Every card in the book is a technology. This one teaches us to fell trees.",
        "box": "bottom",
        "point": "ui:tech:Forestry",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "ui",
        "untilTarget": "techsheet:Forestry",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Research runs on Knowledge. Pour it in…",
