        "point": "ui:tech-pour",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "techFilled",
        "untilTarget": "Forestry",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "…then pay the Gold, and it is ours at once.",
        "box": "top",
        "point": "ui:tech-research",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "techDone",
        "untilTarget": "Forestry",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Knowledge refills by itself — a point an hour, up to ten. Pour it in before the bar is full, or the drip stops.",
        "box": "middle",
        "point": "ui:knowledge",
        "lock": "all",
        "until": "tap",
        "untilTarget": "",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "Close the book and let’s put it to use.",
        "box": "middle",
        "point": "ui:close",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "noOverlay",
        "untilTarget": "",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      },
      {
        "speaker": "advisor",
        "side": "left",
        "text": "And the scroll has a reward for that. Tap it.",
        "box": "middle",
        "point": "quest",
        "lock": "target",
        "until": "questClaimed",
        "untilTarget": "Woodcraft",
        "untilAmount": 0,
        "exit": false
      }
    ]
  },
